Show ingress configuration

Usage:
  olr ingress show [flags]
  olr ingress show [command]

Available Commands:
  providers   List the DNS providers certificates can be obtained through
  service     Show one published service in full
  services    List published services

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for show

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr ingress show [command] --help" for more information about a command.
